# library's own "mui.h" rather than the PRIV-stripped <libraries/mui.h> it
# hands to applications.  Together with "mui.h" being in all.gst this keeps the
# public header out of the library's own translation units entirely; either
# mechanism alone is sufficient, which is deliberate.
